  "notes": "Elk (Mastodon client) signed-out profile view. Near-white #fafafa canvas with no shadows; hierarchy comes from hairline dividers between posts and the tab strip. Single warm orange accent (#cc7d24) for links, hashtags, active tab underline, sign-in button and server name; pinned-post label in lighter orange; boost icon/count turns green when boosted, bookmark turns yellow. Nav items that require login are rendered in light grey while public timelines (Explore/Local/Federated) and Settings stay dark. Avatars are circular, cover image square-cornered, link-preview card and server thumbnail rounded ~11px. Boosts are shown with a small reposter avatar + name line above the original post. Quote buttons are disabled. The capture leaves a long blank area below the 8 posts (virtualized list) before the end-of-timeline note."
